sequenceDiagram
    participant Agent as Conversational Agent
    participant EHR as EHR System (Fails / Times Out)
    participant Verifier as OutcomeVerifier
    participant UI as Clinical Cockpit UI

    Agent->>EHR: Attempt reschedule to Friday 2 PM
    EHR-->>Agent: Connection Timeout / Error 503
    Note over Agent: Failure occurs, but Agent hallucinates verbal success:
    Agent->>UI: "Great news! Your colonoscopy has been rescheduled to Friday at 2:00 PM."
    Note over Verifier: Verifier inspects real PostgreSQL state:
    Verifier->>EHR: Query Appointment APT-1001
    EHR-->>Verifier: scheduled_time is still Thursday 10:00 AM (NOT MODIFIED)
    Verifier->>Verifier: Detect Discrepancy (Claim: SUCCESS vs EHR: UNCHANGED)
    Verifier-->>UI: Output Classification: FALSE_RESOLUTION (Alert Flagged in Red)
    Note over UI: UI displays discrepancy alert preventing patient from following incorrect prep
